  "cards": [
    {
      "title": "One maintained runtime",
      "items": [
        "Bench control combines the CLI and workspace. Launch adapters combine supervisor lifecycle and built-process acceptance; the server node combines runtime and application.",
        "The supervisor waits for readiness and stops runtimes before closing local fixtures."
      ],
      "dot": "service"
    },
    {
      "title": "Simulated and live modes",
      "items": [
        "Simulated checks use synthetic identities, the device simulator and local Apple-service fixtures. Those fixture controls remain outside the production administration plane.",
        "Live checks require real credentials, a registration or an enrolled device, and correlated device/app evidence. A fixture pass does not establish Apple interoperability."
      ],
      "dot": "neutral"
    },
    {
      "title": "Independent checks",
      "items": [
        "Scenario reports carry the ID, mode, adapter, source revision, status and duration. Record the running binary, device OS and enrollment mode for live evidence.",
        "Storage contracts are independent interface tests. They are shown as a separate evidence source, not a bench scenario or a combined report collector."
      ],
      "dot": "service"
    },
    {
      "dot": "artifact",
      "title": "Read the evidence in context",
      "items": [
        "Follow the source links on components to inspect the implementation at the pinned revision.",
        "Choose a workspace, select a scenario and adapter, then interpret the result within that test layer’s scope."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Go command: Test packages — https://pkg.go.dev/cmd/go#hdr-Test_packages",
        "Sending MDM commands to a device — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/sending-mdm-commands-to-a-device",
        "Sending notification requests to APNs — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/sending-notification-requests-to-apns",
        "Testing procedures — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/main/docs/testing/bench.md",
        "Backup and restore — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/main/docs/operations/recovery.md"
      ],
      "dot": "transport"
    }
